OL,3,GUK weather for today and tomorrow
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FSouthern and central areas will
OL,6,Fbe largely dry and bright today.
OL,7,FTurning more unsettled in the north
OL,8,Fwith blustery rain and gales in
OL,9,Fplaces. Feeling warm in the south in
OL,10,Fthe sunny spells, fresher in the north.
OL,11,
OL,12,CTonight:FA band of rain moves south
OL,13,Facross England and Wales tonight,
OL,14,Fturning heavy at times. Blustery
OL,15,Fshowers in the north with strong winds.
OL,16,
OL,17,CTuesday:FHeavy rain slowly clearing
OL,18,Fthe southeast in the morning. A
OL,19,Fbrighter day for many and feeling
OL,20,Ffresh. Winds gradually easing in the
OL,21,Fnorth, with showers too.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
